  "dcterms:title": "EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq knowledge graph (TempO-Seq x WikiPathways)",
  "dcterms:description": "The 'eutoxrisk-temposeq-kg' brick builds a knowledge graph linking EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq gene-expression data to biological pathways. Its build stage reads the 'eutoxrisk' brick assets (pathways, overview and temposeq parquet, derived from EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq data retrieved from the EdelweissData platform, Douglas Connect) and the 'wikipathways' brick (queried via an HDT/SPARQL store). It therefore inherits the same upstream sources as the eutoxrisk-temposeq brick: EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq data (license unstated) and WikiPathways (CC0).",
