  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by the annotation agent (Claude licensing-provenance annotator). This knowledge-graph brick is a derivative of the 'eutoxrisk' (TempO-Seq) and 'wikipathways' biobricks (see stages/scratch.py, which reads both via bb.assets). It carries no license annotation of its own and inherits its terms from those upstreams: EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq data from EdelweissData has NO discoverable license, and WikiPathways is understood to be CC0 (unverified here - the license page returned HTTP 403). Under most-restrictive-governs, the dataset is classed 'unknown' and commercial use is marked 'prohibited' as the conservative verdict for unstated redistribution rights. HUMAN CHECK REQUIRED: resolve the EU-ToxRisk TempO-Seq license on EdelweissData and confirm WikiPathways CC0; this brick's classification should track whatever is decided for eutoxrisk-temposeq.",
